sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Member
  participant A as Adapter
  participant C as Core
  participant T as TG bot

  M->>A: /fuel
  A->>C: create intent
  C-->>A: telegram_url
  A->>M: Stars link + QR
  M->>T: open fuel_token
  T->>C: claim + invoice
  M->>T: pay Stars
  T->>C: fulfill
  C-->>C: x402 + generate
  A->>C: poll status
  A->>M: Fueled → Delivered
